    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You found yourself in an estate, where an ancient retro computer runs a strange, cursed game\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you dive deeper, you\u2019ll realize: the game is more than just a game. Every match is a step toward the truth \u2014 and your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But here, losing isn\u2019t the only way to die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784360/extras/655d9ebb227e91379b69369edff79bec.poster.avif?t=1754814261\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784360/extras/655d9ebb227e91379b69369edff79bec.webm?t=1754814261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784360/extras/655d9ebb227e91379b69369edff79bec.mp4?t=1754814261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong>:  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784360/extras/90d356c4485ed7b78599c6ac53734cc9.avif?t=1754814261\" data-has-big width=800 height=176 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Dice-Based Deckbuilding</i></strong>  <br><i>Build a customizable deck of actions and manipulate cursed dice to survive tense, turn-based encounters with nightmarish foes.</i>   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Game Within a Game</i></strong>  <br><i>Launch and play a mysterious retro game on a pixelated computer interface \u2014 all while trapped inside a 3D haunted mansion.</i>  <br>  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Explore a Living Mansion</i></strong>  <br><i>Navigate a gothic English estate full of secrets, puzzles, strange technology, and voices that shouldn't be speaking to you.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Meta-Horror Storytelling</i></strong>  <br><i>Uncover the dark connection between the game and reality. Why was it made? Who is watching? And how do you stop becoming part of it?</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot;Die to Progress&quot; Loop</i></strong>  <br><i>Death is not the end \u2014 each failure brings you closer to the truth. Unlock shortcuts, story fragments, and hidden mechanics with every attempt.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Retro Aesthetic Meets Modern Fear</i></strong>  <br><i>Classic PC vibes, CRT scanlines, floppy disks, low-res sprites \u2014 all wrapped in a modern horror experience with deep psychological undertones.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i>   </p></li></ul>",
