state full of secrets, puzzles, strange technology, and voices that shouldn't be speaking to you.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Meta-Horror Storytelling</i></strong>  <br><i>Uncover the dark connection between the game and reality. Why was it made? Who is watching? And how do you stop becoming part of it?</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot;Die to Progress&quot; Loop</i></strong>  <br><i>Death is not the end \u2014 each failure brings you closer to the truth. Unlock shortcuts, story fragments, and hidden mechanics with every attempt.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Retro Aesthetic Meets Modern Fear</i></strong>  <br><i>Classic PC vibes, CRT scanlines, floppy disks, low-res sprites \u2014 all wrapped in a modern horror experience with deep psychological undertones.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i>   </p></li></ul>",
